# UI/UX Consistency Rules

- **Design tokens only**: do not invent colors/spacing/radius/shadows. Use repo tokens (see `/signin` + `/signup`).
- **Density standard**: keep cards and forms compact; avoid oversized padding/margins/gaps.
- **Sheets & dialogs**:
  - Small forms → **Dialog**
  - Large/multi-section forms → **Sheet**
  - Avoid “double padding” (Sheet content + inner card padding stacking).
- **Hover/active/focus**: ensure readable contrast (never text and background the same on hover). Icons must adapt to hover/active state.
- **States are mandatory**: loading skeletons, full-height empty states, friendly error with retry.
- **Accessibility**: labels, `aria-*`, keyboard nav, focus rings. No interactive elements without focus-visible styling.

